{
  "_readme": [
    "Which symptoms are worth ASKING ABOUT when a laboratory value is outside",
    "the range printed on the user's own report.",
    "",
    "These are prompts for a question, never a conclusion. An abnormal value",
    "plus a reported symptom is not a diagnosis, and nothing in this file feeds",
    "the condition model — the model is trained on symptoms only.",
    "",
    "Entries are limited to well-established, textbook associations and to",
    "symptoms that exist in the model's vocabulary, so an answer is actually",
    "usable. Anything speculative is deliberately absent: a wrong prompt sends",
    "a worried person down a wrong path.",
    "",
    "This mapping reflects general clinical knowledge and has NOT been reviewed",
    "by a clinician. It must be before this project is used for anything real.",
    "",
    "Keys are `<analyte>_<low|high>`. Values are canonical symptom names."
  ],
